# Supabase Migrations
#
# Database migration files will be placed here as we build the schema.
# Each migration is a timestamped SQL file.
#
# Example (do not create yet):
#   supabase/migrations/20241001000000_create_outfits.sql
#
# Run migrations locally:
#   supabase db push
#
# Generate types from schema:
#   supabase gen types typescript --local > src/types/database.ts
